# fallout.nav: a fully transparent 1x1 cursor for the kiosk compositors (cage), so no mouse pointer shows on
# the car screen (the macro pad has a mouse interface, the gamepad a touchpad). cursors/default and left_ptr are
# one-image Xcursor files (24 px nominal, 1x1 ARGB pixel 0); cage always loads the theme "default", XCURSOR_PATH in the units points only here.
[Icon Theme]
Name=default
Comment=No visible mouse cursor on the car screen
